#!name=Soul
#!desc=Soul全面净化
#!author=ZenmoFeiShi[https://github.com/ZenmoFeiShi], ishowshu[https://github.com/ishowshu], RuCu6[https://github.com/RuCu6], 可莉🅥[https://github.com/luestr/ProxyResource/blob/main/README.md]
#!icon=icon not found
#!category=sooyaaabo
